# Line endings must never be rewritten on checkout.
#
# Two kinds of file here are fingerprinted by their exact bytes, and a CRLF conversion changes
# the fingerprint without changing the content — which looks exactly like tampering. Windows
# CI found this the hard way: the catalog snapshots hashed differently after checkout.
* -text

# Belt and braces for the artefacts whose byte-for-byte identity is the whole point.
crates/pr-catalog/snapshots/** -text -diff
fixtures/** -text
